  verify=["`conda run -n agent-rag-research python -m pytest -q app/test_assembly.py app/test_serve.py -o addopts=\"--disable-socket\"`","`list_tools` dump (no GPU) shows ten tools"],
  accept="With the vector store construction failing, the server builds and the eight SQLite tools answer on fakes; the two search tools raise the actionable error naming `python -m app.doctor --cpu-only`; the tool list is unchanged. Falsified if any SQLite tool touches the vector index or if a search tool returns an empty result instead of raising.",
